[{"language":"zh-CN","category":"快速入门","title":"如何注册账号（图文）","body":"<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/01-register.svg\" alt=\"注册图文步骤\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:12px\"/></p>\n<h2>注册步骤</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>打开 <a href=\"/register\">注册页</a> 或落地页点击「免费注册」。</li>\n<li>填写邮箱与密码（建议 8 位以上）。</li>\n<li>本演示站已关闭强制邀请码，直接提交即可。</li>\n<li>注册成功后进入用户中心。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"/register\"><strong>去注册 →</strong></a></p>","sort":null,"show":1},
{"language":"zh-CN","category":"快速入门","title":"如何登录（图文）","body":"<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/02-login.svg\" alt=\"登录图文步骤\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:12px\"/></p>\n<h2>登录步骤</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>打开 <a href=\"/login\">登录页</a>。</li>\n<li>输入邮箱与密码。</li>\n<li>登录成功后进入仪表盘。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>演示账号：<code>user@demo.com</code> / <code>UserDemo123!</code></p>","sort":null,"show":1},
{"language":"zh-CN","category":"订阅购买","title":"如何购买 / 订阅套餐（图文）","body":"<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/03-subscribe.svg\" alt=\"订阅图文步骤\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:12px\"/></p>\n<h2>购买步骤</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>登录后进入「套餐 / 商店」。</li>\n<li>选择合适套餐与周期。</li>\n<li>创建订单并完成支付（需管理员先配置支付方式）。</li>\n<li>支付成功后，仪表盘可看到到期时间与流量。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>若暂无支付通道，可请管理员在后台直接分配套餐。</p>","sort":null,"show":1},
{"language":"zh-CN","category":"客户端","title":"下载客户端（手机小白图文）","body":"<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/04-download.svg\" alt=\"手机下载客户端\" style=\"max-width:100%;width:100%;border-radius:12px\"/></p>\n<h2>Android（推荐 Clash Meta）</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>用手机浏览器打开下方链接。</li>\n<li>下载最新 APK 并安装（若提示未知来源，到系统设置允许安装）。</li>\n<li>安装后先打开一次 App，再回本站复制订阅。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/MetaCubeX/ClashMetaForAndroid/releases/latest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Android 官方下载（GitHub Releases）</strong></a></p>\n<h2>iPhone（推荐 Shadowrocket）</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>打开 App Store。</li>\n<li>搜索 Shadowrocket 并购买/安装。</li>\n<li>装好后回本站复制订阅，再按「导入」教程操作。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/shadowrocket/id932747118\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>iOS App Store 打开 Shadowrocket</strong></a></p>\n<h2>电脑也可以（可选）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/clash-verge-rev/clash-verge-rev/releases/latest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Windows / macOS / Linux：Clash Verge Rev</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步必看：<a href=\"/knowledge/5\"><strong>如何导入节点 / 订阅（手机小白逐步图文）</strong></a></p><p style=\"margin-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:#64748b\">导入订阅请打开 <a href=\"/knowledge/5\">如何导入节点 / 订阅</a>：Android 只看「一、Clash Meta」；iPhone 只看「二、Shadowrocket」。两平台截图不混用。</p>","sort":null,"show":1},
{"language":"zh-CN","category":"客户端","title":"如何导入节点 / 订阅（Android / iOS 分平台）","body":"<p><strong>请先选平台。</strong>本站「复制订阅」Android / iPhone 做法相同；从「导入 App」起必须只看对应章节。Android 图文只来自 Clash Meta for Android 教程；iPhone 图文只来自 Shadowrocket（fanqiang）教程。禁止混用、禁止仿图。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:#f1f5f9;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6\">\n<strong>目录</strong><br/>\n<a href=\"#site-copy\">〇、本站：复制订阅链接（通用）</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#android-cmfa\">一、Android：Clash Meta for Android</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#ios-shadowrocket\">二、iPhone：Shadowrocket</a>\n</p>\n\n<hr style=\"margin:24px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0\"/>\n\n<h2 id=\"site-copy\">〇、本站：复制订阅链接（Android / iPhone 通用）</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#64748b\">以下为本站仪表盘实拍（手机浏览器），不是 Clash Meta / Shadowrocket 客户端界面。</p>\n\n<h3>0.1 登录本站</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/android-01-login.png?v=20260918split\" alt=\"本站登录\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<ol><li>手机浏览器打开本站</li><li>用邮箱和密码登录</li></ol>\n\n<h3>0.2 找到并复制配置地址</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/android-02-find-subscribe.png?v=20260918split\" alt=\"找到一键导入与复制配置地址\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/android-03-copy.png?v=20260918split\" alt=\"复制配置地址\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<ol><li>进入仪表盘</li><li>点「复制配置地址」，看到「已复制」</li><li>接下来：Android 用户只看「一、Android」；iPhone 用户只看「二、iPhone」</li></ol>\n\n<hr style=\"margin:24px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0\"/>\n\n<h2 id=\"android-cmfa\">一、Android：Clash Meta for Android</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#64748b\">本节<strong>仅</strong>使用 Android 客户端真图。教程来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/clashbk/clash/wiki/clash-meta-for-android\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Clash Meta for Android 使用教程（wiki）</a>。步骤顺序与该教程「使用教程」一致。</p>\n\n<h3>A1. 打开 Clash Meta 主界面</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/android-04-open-app.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"Clash Meta 主界面\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/clashbk/clash/wiki/clash-meta-for-android\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clash-meta-for-android wiki · 界面预览</a></p>\n<ol><li>安装并打开 Clash Meta for Android</li><li>进入软件主界面</li></ol>\n\n<h3>A2. 进入「配置」</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/android-05-config.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"配置界面\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/clashbk/clash/wiki/clash-meta-for-android\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clash-meta-for-android wiki · 配置界面</a></p>\n<ol><li>点击「配置」进入配置界面</li></ol>\n\n<h3>A3. 右上角 ＋ 添加配置</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/android-06-add-mode.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"创建配置方式\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/clashbk/clash/wiki/clash-meta-for-android\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clash-meta-for-android wiki · 创建配置</a></p>\n<ol><li>点右上角 ＋</li><li>选择添加方式：一般选「URL」（从订阅链接导入）</li></ol>\n\n<h3>A4. 从 URL 导入订阅</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/android-07-add-url.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"从 URL 导入配置\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/clashbk/clash/wiki/clash-meta-for-android\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clash-meta-for-android wiki · 从 URL 导入</a></p>\n<ol><li>把本站复制的订阅链接粘贴到 URL</li><li>名称可自定，保存</li></ol>\n\n<h3>A5. 启用系统代理</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/android-08-start.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"启用代理\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/clashbk/clash/wiki/clash-meta-for-android\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clash-meta-for-android wiki · 启用代理</a></p>\n<ol><li>回到主界面，点顶部「已停止」启动系统代理</li><li>系统弹出 VPN 权限时点允许</li></ol>\n\n<h3>A6. 确认已成功启用</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/android-09-start-success.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"成功启用代理\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/clashbk/clash/wiki/clash-meta-for-android\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clash-meta-for-android wiki · 成功启用</a></p>\n<ol><li>顶部应变为已启动 / 运行中</li></ol>\n\n<h3>A7. 切换代理节点</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/android-10-proxy.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"切换节点\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/clashbk/clash/wiki/clash-meta-for-android\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clash-meta-for-android wiki · 切换节点</a></p>\n<ol><li>点「代理」进入节点列表</li><li>选中合适的节点</li></ol>\n\n<h3>A8. 切换代理模式（建议规则模式）</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/android-11-proxy-mode.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"切换代理模式\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/clashbk/clash/wiki/clash-meta-for-android\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clash-meta-for-android wiki · 切换代理模式</a></p>\n<ol><li>在代理页点左上角图标 →「模式」</li><li>新手建议选「规则模式」</li></ol>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#64748b;margin-top:16px\">Android 客户端图全部来自 <a href=\"https://github.com/clashbk/clash/wiki/clash-meta-for-android\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/clashbk/clash/wiki/clash-meta-for-android</a>，未使用任何 iOS / Shadowrocket 截图。</p>\n\n<hr style=\"margin:24px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0\"/>\n\n<h2 id=\"ios-shadowrocket\">二、iPhone：Shadowrocket</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#64748b\">本节<strong>仅</strong>使用 iOS / Shadowrocket 真图。主教程：<a href=\"https://github.com/bannedbook/fanqiang/blob/master/ios/Shadowrocket.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bannedbook/fanqiang · ios/Shadowrocket.md</a>。步骤顺序与该文「配置 Shadowrocket → 分流规则 → 开始使用」一致。未使用任何 Android 客户端截图。</p>\n\n<h3>B1. 设置 → 服务器订阅，打开「打开时更新」</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/ios-fq-01-subscribe-settings.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"服务器订阅 · 打开时更新\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/bannedbook/fanqiang/blob/master/ios/Shadowrocket.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fanqiang Shadowrocket.md</a> 图1 <code>shadowrocket-1.jpg</code>（原链 <a href=\"https://v2free.org/docs/SSPanel/iOS/images/shadowrocket-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">v2free.org/.../shadowrocket-1.jpg</a>）</p>\n<ol><li>打开 Shadowrocket</li><li>底部「设置」→ 滑到最底 →「服务器订阅」</li><li>打开「打开时更新」</li></ol>\n\n<h3>B2. 首页右上角 ＋，类型选 Subscribe</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/ios-fq-02-type-subscribe.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"类型选择 Subscribe\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/bannedbook/fanqiang/blob/master/ios/Shadowrocket.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fanqiang Shadowrocket.md</a> 图2 <code>shadowrocket-2.jpg</code>（原链 <a href=\"https://v2free.org/docs/SSPanel/iOS/images/shadowrocket-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">v2free.org/.../shadowrocket-2.jpg</a>）</p>\n<ol><li>回到首页，点右上角 ＋</li><li>点第一行「类型」，选择 <strong>Subscribe</strong></li></ol>\n\n<h3>B3. 填写备注并粘贴订阅 URL，保存</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/ios-fq-03-paste-url.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"粘贴订阅 URL\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/bannedbook/fanqiang/blob/master/ios/Shadowrocket.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fanqiang Shadowrocket.md</a> 图3 <code>shadowrocket-3.jpg</code>（原链 <a href=\"https://v2free.org/docs/SSPanel/iOS/images/shadowrocket-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">v2free.org/.../shadowrocket-3.jpg</a>）</p>\n<ol><li>「备注」可填本站名称</li><li>「URL」粘贴本站复制的订阅链接</li><li>点右上角保存；会自动更新获取服务器</li></ol>\n\n<h3>B4. 手工更新订阅（教程无单独截图）</h3>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:14px 16px;border:1px dashed #94a3b8;border-radius:12px;background:#f8fafc;color:#334155\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55\">点「服务器节点」最上方订阅链接右边的「i」，再点右上角「完成」。</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源文案：<a href=\"https://github.com/bannedbook/fanqiang/blob/master/ios/Shadowrocket.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fanqiang Shadowrocket.md</a>「小火箭手工更新订阅方法」（无独立配图，不仿图）。</p>\n\n<h3>B5. 选节点并打开「未连接」开关（教程无单独截图）</h3>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:14px 16px;border:1px dashed #94a3b8;border-radius:12px;background:#f8fafc;color:#334155\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55\">选中一个节点，打开右上角「未连接」开关。若提示添加 VPN 配置，点 Allow，并用密码 / Touch ID / Face ID 验证。</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源文案：<a href=\"https://github.com/bannedbook/fanqiang/blob/master/ios/Shadowrocket.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fanqiang Shadowrocket.md</a>「配置 / 开始使用」段落（无独立配图，不仿图）。</p>\n\n<h3>B6.（可选）配置页添加远程分流规则</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/ios-fq-04-remote-config.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"配置页添加远程文件\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/bannedbook/fanqiang/blob/master/ios/Shadowrocket.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fanqiang Shadowrocket.md</a> 图4 <code>shadowrocket-4.jpg</code>（原链 <a href=\"https://v2free.org/docs/SSPanel/iOS/images/shadowrocket-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">v2free.org/.../shadowrocket-4.jpg</a>）</p>\n<ol><li>底部「配置」→ 右上角 ＋</li><li>粘贴远程规则地址并添加</li><li>点新增远程文件 →「使用配置」</li></ol>\n\n<h3>B7. 全局路由改为「配置」</h3>\n<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/steps/ios-fq-05-global-routing.jpg?v=20260918split\" alt=\"全局路由选配置\" style=\"max-width:min(100%,420px);width:auto;height:auto;max-height:min(70vh,720px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:12px auto\"/></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/bannedbook/fanqiang/blob/master/ios/Shadowrocket.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fanqiang Shadowrocket.md</a> 图5 <code>shadowrocket-5.jpg</code>（原链 <a href=\"https://v2free.org/docs/SSPanel/iOS/images/shadowrocket-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">v2free.org/.../shadowrocket-5.jpg</a>）</p>\n<ol><li>回到首页 →「全局路由」</li><li>选择「配置」</li></ol>\n\n<h3>B8. 开始使用：连通性测试（教程无单独截图）</h3>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:14px 16px;border:1px dashed #94a3b8;border-radius:12px;background:#f8fafc;color:#334155\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55\">设置 → 延迟测试方法 → 改为 CONNECT；回首页点「连通性测试」测速，选延迟低的节点后再打开开关。</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b\">来源文案：<a href=\"https://github.com/bannedbook/fanqiang/blob/master/ios/Shadowrocket.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fanqiang Shadowrocket.md</a>「开始使用」段落（无独立配图，不仿图）。</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#64748b;margin-top:16px\">iPhone 客户端图全部来自 <a href=\"https://github.com/bannedbook/fanqiang/blob/master/ios/Shadowrocket.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/bannedbook/fanqiang/blob/master/ios/Shadowrocket.md</a>，未使用任何 Android 客户端截图。</p>\n\n<p><em>缓存版本：20260918split。相关下载说明见知识库「下载客户端」；本文只负责导入订阅且平台严格分离。</em></p>\n","sort":null,"show":1},
{"language":"zh-CN","category":"常见问题","title":"常见问题 FAQ（图文）","body":"<p><img src=\"/theme/Stellar/tutorial/06-faq.svg\" alt=\"FAQ 图文\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:12px\"/></p>\n<h2>FAQ</h2>\n<p><strong>Q: 注册提示要邀请码？</strong><br/>A: 后台关闭强制邀请，或向管理员索取邀请码。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 客户端在哪里下载？</strong><br/>A: 见知识库「下载客户端」，或仪表盘客户端下载入口（已配置官方链接）。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 连不上网？</strong><br/>A: 确认套餐有效 → 更新订阅 → 换节点 → 检查系统时间。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 忘记密码？</strong><br/>A: 登录页使用「忘记密码」，或请管理员后台重置。</p>","sort":null,"show":1}]
